    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115832" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυδνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυδρός</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				122
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυδνὴ χέρσος: ἀραιά, ὀλίγη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: misspelt <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυάνη: ἁρεά, ὀλίγη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theognost.
				<u>Can.</u>
				26
			</span></i>. (With <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυδνός</span> (s. v.l.) cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυδνός;</span> for the sense cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύθιος.</span>)</div>
